      en: ["Coastal lagoon in the Bobonaro municipality", "Designated as Important Bird Area TL01", "Supports over 150 different bird species", "Located near the historic town of Balibo", "Separated from the sea by a narrow sandbar", "Home to the endangered Timor sparrow"],
